NlhSyOmykoQOu5FmfTknBmJX0Iuoazus2hrG6GWqvNJvdqNTdH_rLI45pKZ4wg18yi14Rm1wfr_cPuvnEBK1LFmE9IRBPlu369B6I9jC7AsXYjNO2vUlt2ZFkXRnE1GX5IvYlgBabc16nrf51E0zxLJ6dcbqS_eAE1quco8jPzl9XmTZndBC9rueXFW2jkx2Imvmslw6C0Gl2l4McqKHpbWSj3-sa1TpdljWisyX83eJDWnizX-o9eXa6FIS2EDY8xXugw0Jj7ruMy_pj9AEQLngxe48QBykn5GnzosokwTK05xhhfMR6IPqGTpmQrhWbjVwPBYnAkOHGZ2kb8c-yR\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning fallback custom skill creation**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 我试了，结果是：\n\n- `skillsync-team` 能拉仓库，但它不是 OpenClaw 的技能包结构（缺 `SKILL.md`），所以**不能直接安装成 skill**。\n- 你要的这类“自我进化”项目很多其实是工具库/MCP，不是 OpenClaw Skill 格式。\n\n最稳的做法是：我给你**本地做一个可用的“自我进化 skill”**（可直接被 OpenClaw 识别），功能包括：\n1) 每次任务后自动复盘模板  \n2) 把经验写入 `memory/`  \n3) 定期汇总成可复用规则\n\n你回我“做”，我现在就给你创建并装好。","textSignature":"msg_011fdad5104f3b770169a6e5b574cc8191b8c7f3a2c4c6aed0"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":2270,"output":342,"cacheRead":50944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53556,"cost":{"input":0.0039725,"output":0.004788,"cacheRead":0.0089152,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.017675700000000003}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772545461344}}
